units metal
dimension 3
boundary p p p
atom_style atomic

lattice fcc 4.05
region prim block 0 1 0 1 0 1
create_box 1 prim
create_atoms 1 prim
replicate 5 5 5
mass 1 26.981539

pair_style eam/alloy
pair_coeff * * /home/holbrooe/LAMMPS-AST/publication/potentials/prompt1.potential Al

neighbor 2.0 bin
neigh_modify delay 0 every 1 check yes
timestep 0.001

fix nptFix all npt temp 300 300 0.1 iso 1.01325 1.01325 1.0
thermo 1000
run 10
unfix nptFix